  "marathonInfoTitle": "What is a marathon?",
  "marathonInfoBonusMatrix": "Completion bonus\n25 min: 2 sessions +{shortTwo}, 3 sessions +{shortThree}, 4 sessions +{shortFour} points.\n50 min: 2 sessions +{longTwo}, 3 sessions +{longThree}, 4 sessions +{longFour} points.\n\nThese extra points are awarded once, after every session has been saved and earned regular points, and every continuation is confirmed on time. They are added to the regular session points and do not earn extra sand.",
  "onboardingGuideTitle": "Get to know the app",
  "onboardingGuideBody": "See how each screen works before you begin.",
  "onboardingGuidePomoTitle": "Pomo",
  "onboardingGuidePomoBody": "Choose a category and a 25- or 50-minute session, then tap Start. You can pause once per session; pausing reduces its points. Completed sessions are saved.",
  "onboardingGuideMarathonTitle": "Marathon",
  "onboardingGuideMarathonBody": "Use Start Marathon to plan 2, 3 or 4 sessions. Each break lasts 5 minutes. Tap I’m here within 1 minute after the break to continue; without confirmation, the marathon ends. Completed sessions keep their normal points. Finishing the whole plan adds +2/+3/+5 points for 25-minute sessions or +4/+6/+10 for 50-minute sessions, respectively.",
  "onboardingGuideReportsTitle": "Reports",
  "onboardingGuideReportsBody": "Daily, weekly and monthly reports combine Pomodoro sessions, Marathon focus sessions and completed exams. Breaks and abandoned exams are excluded. The study day changes at 04:00; exam time appears in its own Exam row.",
  "onboardingGuideRankingTitle": "Ranking",
  "onboardingGuideRankingBody": "Study and exam leagues are separate and group people by their goal. Global rankings cover all goals. Periods renew at 00:00 Istanbul time on the first day of each month. Small groups may remain in preparation; the ? guide in Rankings explains promotion and reward conditions.",
  "onboardingGuideSocialTitle": "Social",
  "onboardingGuideSocialBody": "Add friends by code and manage requests. Visible friends appear as Focusing, On break only during Marathon breaks, or Taking an exam. The open list refreshes periodically. Change visibility in Settings, hide users or block them.",
  "onboardingGuideProfileTitle": "Profile",
  "onboardingGuideProfileBody": "Tap your avatar at the top to open Profile. Manage categories, use earned sand to expand your avatar collection, and choose an avatar. You can also find language, theme, notification and visibility settings, help, privacy and account actions here.",
